ub.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-10T12:59:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:20Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\nRelated: #82703 (fixed in 4.2 via #82712) — appears to be a regression or an uncovered case of the same face-selection problem.\n\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 15.7.4 (24G517), Apple Silicon (arm64), Godot v4.7.2.stable.official\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn macOS, a `SystemFont` with `font_names = [\"PingFang SC\"]` resolves to a face that is missing some simplified Chinese glyphs. `Font.has_char()` returns `false` for 迟 (U+8FDF) and 远 (U+8FDC), and these characters render as hex-code placeholder (.notdef) boxes in Labels. Other simplified-only characters (这 边 过 还 进 连 选 设 响 门 关 乐 题 见 页) report `true` and render correctly.\n\nPingFang SC itself definitely contains these characters — it is the macOS Simplified Chinese UI font and renders the same strings correctly in native apps. The pattern (a few simplified-only glyphs missing while most work) suggests the resolver picked a non-SC face from the PingFang font collection — the same class of issue as #82703.\n\nAdditional data points:\n- Localized family name \"苹方-简\" shows the same holes.\n- PostScript name \"PingFangSC-Regular\" and weight-qualified names (\"PingFang SC Semibold\", \"PingFang SC Medium\") do not resolve at all — `has_char` is false for every tested character.\n- Other macOS CJK families resolve with full coverage, including at `font_weight = 600`: Hiragino Sans GB, STHeiti, Heiti SC, Songti SC.\n- The `font_names` fallback chain does NOT fill the hole: `[\"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\"]` still reports `has_char(迟) == false`. If per-glyph fallback across `font_names` entries is not intended behavior, it may be worth documenting; if it is intended, this is a second bug.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Save the script below as `probe.gd` and run `godot --headless -s probe.gd` in any project.\n   (Equivalently, put \"延迟设置\" into a Label using a SystemFont with \"PingFang SC\" — 迟 renders as a hex placeholder box.)\n\n```gdscript\nextends SceneTree\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> bool:\n\tvar f := SystemFont.new()\n\tf.font_names = PackedStringArray([\"PingFang SC\"])\n\tfor ch in [\"迟\", \"远\", \"这\", \"边\", \"设\", \"响\"]:\n\t\tprint(ch, \" U+%04X\" % ch.unicode_at(0), \" has_char=\", f.has_char(ch.unicode_at(0)))\n\tquit()\n\treturn true\n```\n\nActual output:\n```\n迟 U+8FDF has_char=false\n远 U+8FDC has_char=false\n这 U+8FD9 has_char=true\n边 U+8FB9 has_char=true\n设 U+8BBE has_char=true\n响 U+54CD has_char=true\n```\n\nExpected: `has_char` is `true` for all of them (PingFang SC contains all these characters).\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — reproducible with the standalone script above in any empty project, no assets required.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124353/reactions","total_coun